<title>CHINA: HONGKONG BANK SETS HK$3.5 BLN 3-YR FRCD.</title>
<headline>HONGKONG BANK SETS HK$3.5 BLN 3-YR FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was</p>
<p>announced by arranger HSBC Markets.</p>
<p>BORROWER HONGKONG AND SHANGHAI BANKING CORPORATION</p>
<p> AMT	HK$3.5 BLN* COUPON    1MH+20   MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	  ISS PRICE PAR	LAUNCHED  07/AUG/97</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	  CALLS     NONE     REPLIES   07/AUG/97</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	  REPAYMENT BULLET   DENOMS    HK$1 MLN</p>
<p> RATINGS  A2	    SALE LMTS STANDARD PAY DATE  15-AUG-97</p>
<p> CRS DEF  NO	    NEG PLG   NO	 FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW  HK	    HOME CTRY HK</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	    CO-LEADS     HK$200 MLN  21 BP ALL-IN 27BP</p>
<p> NOTES   *ISSUE WAS MADE UNDER A CD PROGRAMME WHICH WAS</p>
<p>	    INCREASED TO HK$30 BLN ON AUGUST 4</p>
<p>	  **APPLICATION WILL BE MADE TO THE HKMA TO ACCEPT THE</p>
<p>	    CERTIFICATES AS ELIGIBLE FOR USE AT ITS LIQUIDITY</p>
<p>	    ADJUSTMENT FACILITY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
</text>
